  "description": "Connect a clinic without touching workflows: n8n form (tenant.json, knowledge base .md files, optional Telegram bot token and operator group) -> upsert_tenant -> admin.reindex -> Telegram setWebhook -> bot rights check in the operator group. The form is reachable only where the n8n UI is (localhost / SSH tunnel)."
